5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'll start us off! I want to look into the Retained recruiters' placement times and the Adviser bench and partner board seats. I'm curious about our capacity to help these teams grow.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I'll take a look at the Account retention through price rises and the Profile of the exits and the write-off. I want to see what actually sticks.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'll go for the Reserve accounts and follow-on calls, plus the Terms of last winter's credit line. Let's see where we actually stand with our liquidity.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'll check the Independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the Appraisal needs at the last audit! I want to know how we handle the numbers.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I will examine the Security review time before first deployment and the Delivery records of two holdings. I want to understand the actual timeline from investment to operation.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
